python-activitytrack (0.9.4~beta2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release: the rules, the local copy, the sync, the policy, the
    reminders' planner and the translations of ActivityTrack Desktop
    0.9.4-beta1, shared with the command line and the text interface. One
    data folder (~/.local/share/activitytrack, %APPDATA%\activitytrack) and
    one pairing for every interface; the desktop's folder and keyring entry
    of 0.9.4-beta1 move there at the first start.

